                <div><strong>Owner sign-in and private storage are not configured.</strong><p>This Astro site currently builds static pages. There is no authentication, private database, or private file bucket, so real product records, uploads, downloads, exports, and DevLabs handoffs are disabled. The preview below is sample data only—it is not saved and clears when you leave or refresh.</p></div>
