                    <button class="workspace-sample-product" type="button" data-sample-product="garden-cart" aria-pressed="false"><span class="workspace-product-monogram workspace-product-monogram--alt">GC</span><span><strong>Portable garden cart</strong><small>Sample · CA / English · Email</small></span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
